@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: AC Trial Routing
	Testing the routing of AC Trial Tickets

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1 |

Scenario: AC Trial Routing
	End users who create requests for the AC Trial organization should have their requests routed to the AC Trial group.

	Given I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | AC Trial                         |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       |
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	When I create several requests as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following product and component values
	| prd_liferay_analytics_cloud | |
	Then the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should be assigned to the group "Analytics Cloud"